Fund_Concrete_Test
├── when the amount is zero
│   └── it should revert
└── when the amount is not zero
    ├── when the pool total would pass 64 bits
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the pool total fits 64 bits
        ├── when less than the amount arrives
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when more than the amount arrives
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when exactly the amount arrives
            ├── it should take the tokens from the funder, whoever it is
            ├── it should add them to the pool total as free money
            └── it should emit {PoolFunded}
